\begin_layout Subsection
Increased Java memory Windows/Linux
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For an increased Java heap space open the Bio7.ini file in the install directory of Bio7.
 In the file you can change the default memory settings e.g.
 the initial heap size -Xms and the maximum heap space -Xmx.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
Increased Java memory MacOSX
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For an increased Java heap space open the Bio7 package (context menu if you click on the icon) then go to Contents/MacOSX and open the Bio7.ini file with a text editor.
 In the file you can change the default memory settings e.g.
 the initial heap size -Xms and the maximum heap space -Xmx
\end_layout

